    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mistakenly shipped off on a research rocket, you find yourself in a strange new world where you must take control of the simulation  to survive and thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world reacts to your every action. Harness chemical reactions, fine-grained temperature simulation and convection, liquids that evaporate, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will need to design and construct solutions to process, refine and build your way out of this ordeal in order to survive and complete your mission imperatives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh, and maybe a little oxygen is included.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manipulate the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/86d769106473754fb29f7ff9d8186b62.poster.avif?t=1750194542\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/86d769106473754fb29f7ff9d8186b62.webm?t=1750194542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/86d769106473754fb29f7ff9d8186b62.mp4?t=1750194542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maybe you weren't expecting to be here, but you're resourceful. Create your own abode in this new world, generating power, food, and oxygen to survive and thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Real time Gas, Liquid and Heat Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/5b8b01f3f2148fab776ca1ea2810e644.poster.avif?t=1750194542\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/5b8b01f3f2148fab776ca1ea2810e644.webm?t=1750194542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/5b8b01f3f2148fab776ca1ea2810e644.mp4?t=1750194542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Water flows and evaporates, fire requires oxygen to burn, and every tile simulates thermal capacity and conductivity. Use the simulation to your advantage to build a dynamic base, or ignore it at your peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Farm with Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/9f636b69fa78fd8ef46ded8cbe6febee.poster.avif?t=1750194542\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/9f636b69fa78fd8ef46ded8cbe6febee.webm?t=1750194542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/9f636b69fa78fd8ef46ded8cbe6febee.mp4?t=1750194542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every element in the game reacts to its environment. Use dirt, seeds and water to create your farm, and manipulate the simulation to optimize your output.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mistakenly shipped off on a research rocket, you find yourself in a strange new world where you must take control of the simulation  to survive and thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world reacts to your every action. Harness chemical reactions, fine-grained temperature simulation and convection, liquids that evaporate, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will need to design and construct solutions to process, refine and build your way out of this ordeal in order to survive and complete your mission imperatives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh, and maybe a little oxygen is included.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manipulate the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/86d769106473754fb29f7ff9d8186b62.poster.avif?t=1750194542\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/86d769106473754fb29f7ff9d8186b62.webm?t=1750194542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/86d769106473754fb29f7ff9d8186b62.mp4?t=1750194542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maybe you weren't expecting to be here, but you're resourceful. Create your own abode in this new world, generating power, food, and oxygen to survive and thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Real time Gas, Liquid and Heat Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/5b8b01f3f2148fab776ca1ea2810e644.poster.avif?t=1750194542\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/5b8b01f3f2148fab776ca1ea2810e644.webm?t=1750194542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/5b8b01f3f2148fab776ca1ea2810e644.mp4?t=1750194542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Water flows and evaporates, fire requires oxygen to burn, and every tile simulates thermal capacity and conductivity. Use the simulation to your advantage to build a dynamic base, or ignore it at your peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Farm with Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/9f636b69fa78fd8ef46ded8cbe6febee.poster.avif?t=1750194542\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/9f636b69fa78fd8ef46ded8cbe6febee.webm?t=1750194542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/9f636b69fa78fd8ef46ded8cbe6febee.mp4?t=1750194542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every element in the game reacts to its environment. Use dirt, seeds and water to create your farm, and manipulate the simulation to optimize your output.</p>",
